<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '26px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 33, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>精确验证：通过才建边，边就是后面一切判断的依据</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>07 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '8px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>对 5 个候选跑 LightGlue 精确配对，RANSAC 剔除外点，内点数超过 500 才写进协视图。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 600, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输入</b>　② 留下的 5 个候选帧</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>做法</b>　LightGlue 精确配对 ＋ RANSAC 剔外点；内点数 |M_ij| 即“这条边有多可信”</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '9px 16px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>输出</b>　加权协视图 G = (M, E, W)，边权 w_ij = 1/|M_ij|</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 6, padding: '10px 16px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45 }}><b>关键取值</b>　τ_m = 500 内点　·　min_matches_edge = 500</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>边权取内点数倒数：内点越多边越短，于是图上“最短路”= 最可靠的位姿链</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 580, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Image src="figs/fig3_lightglue.png" style={{ width: 580, height: 362 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#8B97A8', marginTop: 5 }}>图 3　绿=内点、红叉=被 RANSAC 剔除；通过的帧对才成为图上的一条边。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '12px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '5px solid #1E4FA8', padding: '10px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Image src="formula/f07.png" style={{ width: 498.0, height: 30.5 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 3 }}>这是全链唯一产生“共视约束”的地方——后面所有位姿都由这些点对推出来，边建错，后面全歪。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 40px 12px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>到这一步为止，一张图还没解；但“谁和谁能一起算”已经确定下来了。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
